icknames, size 4 feet to 4 feet 6 inches, weight 100-150 lbs, life span 3D6+50, habitat, slave market value 2D4x10,000, allies and enemies are in GM Notes and on the shu-shuum creatures row. Experience Level 1D6+1 for NPCs is a population figure."
