## Lore

Soon after the Great Cataclysm a Sovietski patrol in the Ural foothills met
a starving tribe of small grey people armed with little more than clubs.
The Rifts had torn them from their world months before and more than half
of them had already died. The patrol brought them home, and nearly every
Shu-Shuum on Earth descends from that group.

Ten thousand years as a conquered people made them quiet, obedient and
content with routine, and the Sovietski is the kindest master they have
known. They are gifted with numbers, details and organization and want
nothing more than to keep the books, plan the logistics and file the
paperwork well, with no wish for power, wealth or praise.

Short, squat and wrinkled, with pug noses, small dark eyes, big crumpled
ears and a few strands of black hair, they strike humans as homely, and
humans strike them as loud, pushy and far too tall. Most prefer their own
company; a few, called Wanderers, go out to see the world.

## GM Notes

Pronounced Shoo-SHOOM. Nicknamed Grey Dwarves and Cabbage Heads, and for
their work Number Crunchers or Money Rollers. 4 feet to 4 feet 6 inches (1.2
to 1.3 m), 100 to 150 lbs (45 to 67.5 kg), squat and heavy-set. Life span
3D6+50 years; mature at 12, and few form lasting pairs.

Disposition: devoted to doing a job well, early and cheaply. They dislike loud, pushy, lazy or frivolous people, rarely complain
or confront anyone, and are masters of passive aggression toward liars and
idlers. They hate physical work and adventuring.

Habitat: Russia and Eurasia, 70% in Sovietski cities, with families as far
as Poland and the NGR; Warlords of Russia, Mindwerks, Triax and the Yama
Kings all keep some. Slave market value 2D4x10,000 credits for one trained
in accounts, management or engineering, half that for a novice.

Allies: most are loyal Communist Party members, and abroad they attach
themselves to any large, efficient organization, the European Black Market
included. Enemies: they compete with each other and with human brown-nosers
for best worker, dislike rugged individualists, jocks, bullies and idlers,
and fear monsters, demons, evil supernatural beings, slavers and humans who
hate other races. Tales of the Minion War, the Splugorth and the Angel of
Death frighten them.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'sovietski-shu-shuum');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'sovietski-shu-shuum';

